	(text "SSI2164 CH3: pins 10 IIN3, 11 VC3, 12 IOUT3. MODE pin 1 open = Class AB.\nCurrent output is converted by U60A; it is not treated as a voltage output."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 203.2 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
